Bitwild Team Kit includes components with different licensing terms.

The included BSD-3-Clause, MIT, and Apache-2.0 notices apply to the corresponding
components identified in SOURCES.md. Original license texts are provided in
licenses/ and in the skill directories where applicable. The product schema,
company generators, and document reference assets retain their existing terms.
Bundling them with other components does not grant a new license to those files.
